{"id":"n57325-1-8","stage":1,"title":"박수 · 鼓掌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57325-1-8-1","ko":"어머, 아기가 노래에 맞춰 박수를 치네?","zh":"哎呀，宝宝还跟着音乐拍手呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦。","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기가","audio":"/audio/26e60641381a50692ff7.mp3"}},{"text":"노래에","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래에","audio":"/audio/6b0a9aefe8d1f65be67f.mp3"}},{"text":"맞춰","meaning":"迎合，配合","explanation":"맞추다：迎合，配合；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞추다","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74127","senseId":"8","lemma":"맞추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞춰","audio":"/audio/c9803242a59a4fbefcde.mp3"}},{"text":"박수를","meaning":"鼓掌，拍手","explanation":"박수：鼓掌，拍手；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"박수","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57325","senseId":"1","lemma":"박수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"박수를","audio":"/audio/90e6af251704e309592c.mp3"}},{"text":"치네?","meaning":"拍打，鼓，击","explanation":"치다：拍打，鼓，击；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","sen